us trochilus\"), \u021big\u0103nu\u0219 (\"Plegadis falcinellus\"), ploier auriu (\"Pluvialis apricaria\"), \"Pterocles orientalis\", m\u0103r\u0103cinar (\"Saxicola rubetra\"), m\u0103r\u0103cinar negru (\"Saxicola torquatus\"), ra\u021b\u0103 c\u00e2r\u00e2itoare (\"Spatula querquedula\"), turturic\u0103 (\"Streptopelia turtur\"), \"Sylvia melanothorax\", \"Sylvia ruppeli\", fluierar de mla\u0219tin\u0103 (\"Tringa glareola\"), fluierarul de z\u0103voi (\"Tringa ochropus\"), pup\u0103z\u0103 (\"Upupa epops\"), nag\u00e2\u021b sudic (\"Vanellus spinosus\"), nag\u00e2\u021b (\"Vanellus vanellus\"), \"Zapornia pusilla\"."}
