{"id": "3122097", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3122097", "title": "Eugen S\u00e2rbu", "text": "Eugen S\u00e2rbu () a fost un violonist clasic rom\u00e2n. A avut o carier\u0103 interna\u021bional\u0103 ca solist, recitalist \u0219i dirijor (de la vioar\u0103). \u00cen 1978, a c\u00e2\u0219tigat at\u00e2t Concursul Paganini, c\u00e2t \u0219i Concursul interna\u021bional de vioar\u0103 Carl Flesch. A lansat \u00een premier\u0103 lucr\u0103ri de la compozitori \u00een via\u021b\u0103, inclusiv Einojuhani R\u0103utavaara, scrise pentru el, a \u00eenregistrat concerte pentru vioar\u0103 de Sibelius \u0219i Mozart. "}
